{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43309","headline":"言行相顾 · 吴叔达","name":"言行相顾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人垂政教，万古请常传。\n立志言爲本，修身行乃先。\n相须宁得阙，相顾在无偏。\n荣辱当於己，忠贞必动天。\n大名如副宝，至道亦通玄。\n千里犹能应，何云迩者焉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴叔达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}